<section id="watch" aria-labelledby="h-watch">
  <h2 id="h-watch" class="sec">Watch</h2>
  <p class="sub">Rollouts from our runs. Watch the control and treatment of one test side by side, or browse every task of one run.</p>
  <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Watch mode">
    <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-compare" aria-controls="compare-clips" aria-selected="true">Compare runs</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-scenes" aria-controls="scenes" aria-selected="false">Browse one run</button>
  </div>
  <div id="compare-clips" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-compare">
    <div class="filters" id="cv-pick" hidden>
      <label class="wide">Test <select id="cv-test"></select></label>
      <label id="cv-trt-wrap">Treatment <select id="cv-trt"></select></label>
      <label id="cv-o1-wrap" hidden>Control <select id="cv-o1"></select></label>
      <label id="cv-o2-wrap" hidden>Treatment <select id="cv-o2"></select></label>
      <label>Task <select id="cv-task"></select></label>
    </div>
    <p class="scnote" id="cv-help">Control and Treatment are the two arms of one test: same tasks, same seed, one change.</p>
    <p class="cvdiff" id="cv-diff" hidden></p>
    <p class="cvctl" id="cv-ctl" hidden></p>
    <p class="callout" id="cv-empty" style="margin-top:0">Loading published clips.</p>
    <div class="sclabels" id="cv-notes" hidden></div>
    <div class="cvbar" id="cv-bar" role="group" aria-label="Playback for all clips" hidden>
      <button type="button" class="cvbtn" id="cv-play" aria-label="Play all">Play</button>
      <button type="button" class="cvbtn" id="cv-back" aria-label="Back one frame" title="Back one frame">&#9664;|</button>
      <button type="button" class="cvbtn" id="cv-fwd" aria-label="Forward one frame" title="Forward one frame">|&#9654;</button>
      <input type="range" id="cv-seek" min="0" max="1" step="0.001" value="0" aria-label="Position in all clips">
      <span class="cvtime" id="cv-time" aria-live="off">0:00.0 / 0:00.0</span>
      <span class="cvspeed" role="group" aria-label="Playback speed">
        <button type="button" class="cvbtn" data-rate="0.5" aria-pressed="false">0.5x</button>
        <button type="button" class="cvbtn" data-rate="1" aria-pressed="true">1x</button>
        <button type="button" class="cvbtn" data-rate="2" aria-pressed="false">2x</button>
      </span>
      <label class="cvloop"><input type="checkbox" id="cv-loop" checked> Loop</label>
      <button type="button" class="cvbtn" id="cv-link">Copy link</button>
      <span class="copied" id="cv-copied" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="cvgrid" id="cv-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <p class="scnote" id="cv-note" hidden>All clips share one clock. A shorter clip holds its last frame while the others play on.</p>
  </div>
  <div id="scenes" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-scenes" hidden>
    <div class="filters" id="scenes-filters" hidden>
      <label>Run <select id="sc-run"></select></label>
      <label>Family <select id="sc-fam"></select></label>
    </div>
    <p class="scdesc" id="sc-desc" hidden></p>
    <div class="sclabels" id="sc-labels" hidden></div>
    <p class="callout" id="sc-empty" style="margin-top:0">Loading scenes.</p>
    <div class="scenes" id="sc-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <p class="scnote" id="sc-attr"><span id="sc-model"></span><a id="sc-files" href="https://github.com/benceruleanlu/playworld-advancement/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>All files of this run</a></p>
  </div>
  <p class="scnote">Each clip names the model that generated it. The judge's comments are its own words, often in Chinese; where shown in English they were machine-translated for display after scoring, and the original text ("show original") is authoritative. Rollouts start from <a href="https://github.com/kxding/PlayWorld" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PlayWorld</a> task images, which come from Pexels and web image search under their own terms. Scene videos are released under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>, non-commercial. To request removal of a scene, <a href="https://github.com/benceruleanlu/playworld-advancement/issues/new?title=Scene+removal+request" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open an issue</a>.</p>
</section>
